  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Presence = DsFreeRing Set",
      "items": [
        "Presence Lookup 就是 DsFreeRing.contains(uid)；这是本改 DsFreeRing 新增 Set 语义的典型 inode 集合用法：64-bit uid → contains/offerUnique/remove/snapshot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Persist First",
      "items": [
        "先 msg 写 p2p-db MVCC 并索引 conv/user；然后才做 Presence 路由和推送。这样任何断连都可重放未推送"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Receipt Contract",
      "items": [
        "Delivered 是服务端事件；Read 是客户端主动事件；两者都是 msg-id 级细粒度，支持单会话内多消息独立状态"
      ]
    }
  ]
